# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The knowledge vault is the user's SOURCE OF TRUTH and personal data. It is
# versioned in its OWN git repository (see docs/SETUP.md), not inside this
# code repo. `knowledge init` recreates its structure on a fresh clone, so
# we exclude the default vault path here. If you point KS_VAULT_PATH somewhere
# else, add that path to your own ignore rules.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/knowledge-vault/

